 "glbPatch": {
  "reason": "DEF g12 scythe strike: the capture left the scythe hanging at the side in the left hand while only the free arm waved. AttackFront now levels the scythe two-handed pointing back (f1), swings it up over the shoulder (f2-f3), sweeps it forward at the waist with a forward lean (f4) and follows through down-front (f5-f7). The shaft aim is split between LeftForeArm (0.8) and LeftHand so the wrist does not break. Weight repair first: armpit diffuseWeights on both sides plus a small LeftForeArm-inclusive diffuse at the left armpit seam (the base's worst edge, Death 10.9x -> the leg crease 9.4x; edges over 2x 901 -> 884 with the strike).",
